<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-HOIU BUYS LATVIAN BROKERAGE INVEKS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-HOIU BUYS LATVIAN BROKERAGE INVEKS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank said on Monday it has bought 76 percent of Latvian brokerage company Inveks.</p>
<p>Inveks, established in 1995, has share capital of 45,240 lats and had a small profit last year, the bank added in a statement.  </p>
<p>Inveks market share in the Latvian security market is over 10 percent.</p>
<p>Inveks plans to get membership of the Riga bourse in the near future. It will also start trading with the shares of Hoiupank Asset Management funds.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
